<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#102b46">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg">
  <title>Reservas | HotelReserve Pro</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/reservations.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
      <a class="brand" href="/dashboard"><span class="brand-mark">H</span><span>HotelReserve <strong>Pro</strong></span></a>
      <p class="nav-heading">PRINCIPAL</p>
      <nav aria-label="Navegación principal">
        <a class="nav-link" href="/dashboard"><span class="nav-icon">01</span> Panel general</a>
        <a class="nav-link active" href="/reservations"><span class="nav-icon">02</span> Reservas</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/rooms"><span class="nav-icon">03</span> Habitaciones</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/guests"><span class="nav-icon">04</span> Huéspedes</a>
        <a class="nav-link" href="/availability"><span class="nav-icon">05</span> Disponibilidad</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="sidebar-bottom">
        <div class="hotel-label"><span class="hotel-dot"></span><span><strong>Hotel El Turista</strong><small>Panel de administración</small></span></div>
        <p id="logout-error" class="error-text" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <button class="logout-button" id="logout-button" type="button">Cerrar sesión</button>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <main class="main-content">
      <header class="topbar">
        <button class="menu-button" id="menu-button" type="button" aria-label="Abrir menú">☰</button>
        <div class="breadcrumb">HotelReserve Pro <span>/</span> Reservas</div>
        <div class="user-menu"><span class="user-avatar">A</span><span class="user-details"><strong><%= user.username %></strong><small><%= user.role === 'admin' ? 'Administrador' : 'Recepcionista' %></small></span></div>
      </header>
      <section class="page-content">
        <div class="page-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">ESTADÍAS DEL HOTEL</p><h1>Reservas</h1><p class="welcome">Registra estadías y controla su confirmación y cancelación.</p></div>
          <button class="primary-button" id="new-reservation-button" type="button">＋ Nueva reserva</button>
        </div>
        <p id="page-message" class="page-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        <section class="panel-card" aria-labelledby="reservations-title">
          <div class="panel-heading"><div><h2 id="reservations-title">Listado de reservas</h2><p>Las reservas pendientes y confirmadas bloquean la habitación para el período.</p></div><span class="data-label">SQL Server</span></div>
          <div class="filters">
            <label class="filter-field" for="status-filter"><span>Estado</span>
              <select id="status-filter">
                <option value="">Todos los estados</option>
                <option value="PENDING_DEPOSIT">Pendiente</option>
                <option value="CONFIRMED">Confirmada</option>
                <option value="IN_PROGRESS">En curso</option>
                <option value="COMPLETED">Finalizada</option>
                <option value="CANCELLED">Cancelada</option>
              </select>
            </label>
          </div>
          <div class="table-wrap">
            <table>
              <thead><tr><th>Huésped</th><th>Habitación</th><th>Entrada</th><th>Salida</th><th>Huéspedes</th><th>Estado</th><th><span class="sr-only">Acciones</span></th></tr></thead>
              <tbody id="reservations-table-body"></tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <div class="empty-state" id="empty-state" hidden><span class="empty-mark">R</span><strong id="empty-title">Todavía no hay reservas</strong><p id="empty-description">Crea una reserva para verla en este listado.</p></div>
        </section>
        <footer class="page-footer">HotelReserve Pro <span>·</span> Versión 1.0.0</footer>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
  <div class="mobile-scrim" id="mobile-scrim"></div>

  <dialog class="reservation-dialog" id="reservation-dialog" aria-labelledby="form-title">
    <form id="reservation-form">
      <div class="dialog-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">ESTADÍAS DEL HOTEL</p><h2 id="form-title">Nueva reserva</h2></div><button class="icon-button" id="close-dialog-button" type="button" aria-label="Cerrar formulario">×</button></div>
      <p class="dialog-intro">Selecciona fechas y huéspedes para consultar habitaciones operativas sin cruces de reserva.</p>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label for="check-in">Fecha de entrada<input id="check-in" name="checkIn" type="date" required></label>
        <label for="check-out">Fecha de salida<input id="check-out" name="checkOut" type="date" required></label>
        <label for="guest-count">Cantidad de huéspedes<input id="guest-count" name="guestCount" type="number" min="1" max="12" value="1" required></label>
        <label for="guest-id">Huésped responsable<select id="guest-id" name="guestId" required><option value="">Cargando huéspedes...</option></select></label>
        <label class="wide" for="room-id">Habitación disponible<select id="room-id" name="roomId" required disabled><option value="">Consulta primero las fechas</option></select></label>
      </div>
      <button class="secondary-button search-rooms-button" id="search-rooms-button" type="button">Consultar habitaciones disponibles</button>
      <p class="form-error" id="form-error" role="alert" aria-live="polite"></p>
      <div class="dialog-actions"><button class="secondary-button" id="cancel-dialog-button" type="button">Cancelar</button><button class="primary-button" id="save-reservation-button" type="submit">Crear reserva</button></div>
    </form>
  </dialog>
  <script src="/js/reservations.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
